                    8–12/79. Secret; Sensitive. The meeting took place in the White House Situation
                    Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d95-f2" n="2" xml:id="d95-f2-content">
                <p>These comments are presumably addressed to Carter.</p>
            </note>
